WEBVTT

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:31.170
<i>Shiro...</i>

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:32.960
<i>Until the day you return...</i>

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:36.170
<i>I will do everything I can on my part</i>,

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:40.720
<i>As your Silver Clansman, Yatogami Kuroh...</i>

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:47.310
Captain Munakata is
waiting for you in his office.

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:51.560
Hey, where's your partner?

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:54.190
Neko didn't want to come.

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:58.570
She's a disobedient stray cat
just as her name implies.

00:02:58.570 --> 00:02:59.900
Great...

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:18.840
First of all, my thanks for assisting
in the arrest of the suspect.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:27.270
I was told that you two went missing after being caught in the bomb incident started by the Green Clan, JUNGLE.

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:31.390
Yes. We narrowly escaped from the blast.

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:35.730
But it seemed we were the ones they were after,

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:38.110
so we went into hiding.

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:40.860
A very prudent decision.

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:43.910
Were we targeted...

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:48.120
because we're Silver Clansmen?

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:52.960
It's a fact that the Green Clan
is searching for the Silver King.

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:55.250
And who could provide a better lead

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:58.800
than Silver King
Adolf K. Weisman's own clansman,

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:02.300
the first one he's made since coming out
of his over half a century life of solitude...

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.180
That would be you, Yatogami Kuroh-kun.

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:10.560
You and that young Strain girl.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:13.310
It's only natural you were targeted.

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:17.190
Just what exactly is the Green Clan?

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:19.480
They are bizarre.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:21.780
While there are clansmen,

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:25.700
very few of them have ever
actually met the Green King.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:30.330
I understand they're a unique clan
who are organized through the internet.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:35.960
Still, it's more than odd that
they've never met their own king.

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:37.750
I agree.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:42.340
Perhaps "clansmen" is
the wrong term to describe them.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.510
Hisui Nagare the Green King maintains control

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:54.810
through a social network service known as JUNGLE.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.310
And this is JUNGLE's site?

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.310
Yes.

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:01.860
People who are not aware
of the existence of clans or power

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:05.820
log in to JUNGLE thinking
it's just another SNS website.

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:10.950
These normal users are referred to as "E-Rank," taken from the last letter of JUNGLE.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:13.200
As the lowest-ranked members,

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:15.120
they participate in "missions" and

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:20.000
earn points for completing them
and move up in rank.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:25.420
You're saying the crimes being committed
around the city by JUNGLE are actually...

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:30.260
Indeed. They are missions
in order to gain JUNGLE points.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:34.230
It's as though they've taken
an internet game and made it real.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:36.390
With the points earned,

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:40.480
they move up to L-Rank, G-Rank...

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:42.820
And they acquire special, temporary powers.

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:46.700
If they fail a mission, they lose points,

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:48.660
and depending on the circumstances,

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:51.280
they lose their temporary powers altogether.

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:56.410
Once these suspects are cut off
by JUNGLE and turn normal...

00:05:56.410 --> 00:06:01.250
there's nothing we can do
but turn them in to the police.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:06.090
But there must be clansmen
who've acquired real power too, right?

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:13.220
J-Rank, the very few who've made it
to the highest rank of the clan...

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:16.560
no doubt have met the Green King Hisui Nagare

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:19.730
and received powers from him personally.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:24.400
And yes, one of them is the man
you're probably thinking of right now...

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:26.490
Mishakuji Yukari.

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:35.750
Has Mishakuji Yukari made contact
with you since your last encounter?

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.250
No...

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:39.370
What about the Silver King?

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:41.330
If he did, I wouldn't be here!

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:46.510
Did the Silver King say anything about the Slates?

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:47.720
No...

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:54.350
The time I spent with him after his memories about being the Silver King returned...

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:55.390
was so short.

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:59.100
We had no time to talk about anything like that.

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:00.600
I see.

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:03.060
Did anything happen to the Slates?

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:04.520
No.

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:07.900
However, with the Gold King still missing...

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:11.240
the safekeeping of the Slates rests with me.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.700
If the Silver King,

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:17.370
who knows more about the Slates than anyone,
left any information regarding them...

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:19.870
I would like to know. That's all.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:25.090
Sorry, I'm afraid I can't be much of help.

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:27.420
If we're done, then I'd like to excuse myself.

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:32.050
Yatogami Kuroh-kun...

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:37.560
As I recall, the Silver Clan does not
have a territory, correct?

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:39.560
Is that relevant?

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.100
Considering the situation,

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:45.770
not having a base of operations
must be inconvenient.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:47.820
If you'd like...

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:51.860
I offer you SCEPTER 4's protection.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:55.570
You can take up residence in our home base...

00:07:55.570 --> 00:08:00.040
and I promise you protection
should an emergency arise.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:05.580
I appreciate the offer, but no thanks.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:08.340
My, how disappointing.

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:13.220
I thought you and I had a pretty
good chemistry with each other...

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:16.100
It's not about chemistry!

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:22.980
You don't want to be beholden
to another clan, is that it?

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:24.690
It's not that either.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:27.020
Just that I...

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.820
Fushimi-kun...

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:37.990
Do you have a minute?

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:42.160
Are you done questioning Yatogami Kuroh?

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:47.000
Yes. He's probably signing out
of the building as we speak.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:50.130
Fushimi-kun, please tail him.

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:56.090
There's a chance the Green Clan
will target him again.

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:57.890
So keep an eye on him.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:00.890
Yes, sir...

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:05.270
Make sure Awashima-kun is kept
up to date with your findings.

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.940
That is all.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:09.770
Where are you off to, Captain?

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:11.780
Mihashira Tower.

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:13.780
Again?

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:19.490
Lately, you spend much more time in the Chamber of Slates than you do here at home base.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:26.870
A cat?

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:32.590
Kuro!

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:34.420
Yes?

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.180
Oh, um...

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:38.340
I was calling at the cat.

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:39.890
Ah...

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:43.180
"Kuro" as in black cat.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:44.520
Sorry.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:54.400
Zenjo-san...

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:59.240
Can you spare a minute?

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:12.590
How may I help you, Lieutenant?

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:15.510
I'd like to talk about something today...

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:18.470
not as the lieutenant, but as an individual...

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:22.720
with the former right-hand man
of Habari Jin, the previous Blue King.

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:25.980
The one nicknamed Zenjo the Ogre... Zenjo Goki.

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:32.860
I doubt I have anything useful to tell you.

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:37.490
You are the only one from
the previous Blue King Habari Jin's clan.

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:42.200
that Captain Munakata personally recruited...

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:45.620
I'm merely a clerk in the Documents Office.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:47.660
The Kagutsu Incident 14 years ago

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:52.130
during which the Sword of Damocles
of the ex-Red King crashed.

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:57.010
You lost your left arm during that disaster.

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:58.970
I have heard that without you,

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:03.970
the change in Japan's topography
would have been far more disastrous.

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:05.220
Had things been worse,

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:09.060
the entire Japanese archipelago
could have been torn apart.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:15.610
The Weismann level of the then-Red King
Kagutsu Genji became unstable.

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:19.780
Its influence threatened your king,
Habari Jin the Blue King,

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:22.160
with a Damocles Down.

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.490
However, the worst was averted.

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:30.580
Because before that could happen Zenjo-san...

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:33.670
You slew the king yourself.

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:34.920
Yes.

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:40.300
I realize this is an impudent question.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:42.840
But please tell me...

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:45.390
Did you notice anything different
about the previous Blue King's behavior

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:48.180
before his Sword of Damocles reached its limit?

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:51.690
You're worried about the Captain, aren't you?

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:57.440
The Captain's Sword of Damocles is damaged.

00:11:57.440 --> 00:12:01.700
It seems there are others who have noticed this.

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.450
How is the Captain?

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:07.950
He seems to be his usual self.

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:12.120
But ever since he's been put
in charge of Mihashira Tower,

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:15.080
he spends more and more time
in the Chamber of Slates.

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:17.340
And every time he goes there...

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:20.590
I sense a change in him.

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:22.380
I see...

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:25.760
I'm afraid...

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:30.470
That the reason the Captain
asked you to SCEPTER 4...

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:34.980
is to make you carry out
the same act of the past.

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:38.110
Are you sure that's my job?

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:44.280
Munakata Reisi's right-hand man is not me. It's you.

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:47.990
Thank you for the refreshment.

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:50.790
It's been a while since I had something sweet.

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:52.790
It was delicious.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:58.040
Dresden Slates, possessor of mysterious power...

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:01.090
Obey me...

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:06.300
It's no good!

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:08.390
I can't see Shiro!

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:09.180
Are you sure that thing showed you...

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:10.810
I can't see Shiro at all!

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:12.270
the Silver King?

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:13.930
I did see Shiro!

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:15.230
I looked into the marble and

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:17.980
I saw Shiro on the other side and he looked fine!

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:25.240
I infused energy into that marble to enable you to see the person you most want to meet.

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:29.370
Well, if you say so, Anna, then it must be true.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:33.160
But I only saw Shiro that one time.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:37.000
Please, Anna, let me see Shiro again!

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:41.590
You can't see him all the time.

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:44.210
But there's no doubt you're connected.

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:48.510
The one who is precious to you just might be looking at you too.

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:50.260
Really?

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:53.140
Shiro! Shiro! Can you see me?!

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:54.770
Sheesh! Hey you!

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:58.060
What's the big idea,
acting like you belong here?!

00:13:58.060 --> 00:14:00.650
You're from another clan!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:01.860
Well...

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:06.280
The boss with glasses was trying to
take us away for questioning or whatever!

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:10.740
So you escaped and took refuge here?

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:14.080
Well, if you stay in our territory,

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:17.660
the Blues won't be able to touch you.

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:21.540
Hey! HOMRA isn't your safe house!

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:24.710
But I hate the boss with glasses!

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.720
And the jerk with glasses too!

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:29.300
Don't wanna go to the Blue Clan's place!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.800
What happened to the Black Dog?

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:33.310
I dunno.

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:35.180
"Dunno"?

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:37.310
I'm not worried about Kurosuke.

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:42.310
I can always see him even if we're apart.

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:47.030
For questioning, huh?

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:52.700
I guess even the Blues are stumped
about what the Greens are up to.

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:55.740
What a creepy bunch.

00:14:55.740 --> 00:15:00.870
The whole city is crawling with people who are part
of the Greens, but most of them are just normal dudes!

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:04.340
We don't even know if they really
are clansmen or not!

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:07.800
People going about their daily lives
fiddling with their PDAs

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:10.010
turn out to be linked to the Greens.

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.090
This is such a pain in the ass.

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:16.720
They won't come after Anna again, will they?

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:19.270
Anna is now the Red King.

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:22.810
They won't be able to touch her
that easily anymore.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:25.770
Even if they do, I'll be fine.

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:30.110
I inherited the red from Mikoto.

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:32.820
I can fight them with my red.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.160
I won't lose.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:37.700
Are you sure, Anna?

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:42.920
Kurosuke said something about the
Red power being destined for destruction...

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:49.420
It's not like you're going to go kaboom
with the King's power... will you?

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:11.700
I'm not as strong as Mikoto.

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:13.450
But I have this feeling...

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.820
that I'll be just fine...

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:21.080
King...

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:26.590
What is it? I didn't call for you.

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:30.380
Yeah, but it's over.

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:32.880
Any further destruction is meaningless.

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:36.640
Destruction is destruction.
There is no meaning to it.

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:38.970
Well, yeah.

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:53.030
You're probably going to say
this is a power to protect, right?

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:59.030
Power itself destroys... It's a monster.

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:06.290
It's a matter of how one uses it.

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:09.130
If you have something precious near you,

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:11.590
then it can become a power to protect.

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:13.920
And the monster will become your friend.

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:14.680
Right?

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:17.680
Mikoto, your red is pretty.

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:20.930
You think so?

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:51.880
I acquired this power in order to protect.

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:56.130
I have Izumo... Misaki... Rikio...

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:57.380
And everyone at HOMRA.

00:17:57.380 --> 00:17:59.930
So are Tatara and Mikoto.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:02.760
That's why I'll be fine.

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:05.520
This pretty red is my friend.

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:10.560
I'm... I'm gonna protect you too, Anna!

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:16.070
I mean... I know you're
way stronger than me now.

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:17.530
But still...

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:22.080
All this time, I kept saying how great Mikoto-san was...

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:24.240
without really trying to understand him.

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:27.790
And I guess there's still a lot that I don't know about...

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:31.540
But... I want to be someone you can rely on.

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:36.170
I'll be someone you can lean on, Anna!

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:38.050
Yata-san...

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:42.430
You'll be fine, Anna I'm so happy!

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:43.060
Uh-huh.

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:46.140
I'll bring Shiro when he returns!

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:52.810
Shiro's been a king for a long time,
so he can teach you lots of stuff!

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:55.940
Yes, I'd love to talk to him.

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:57.650
Hey, hold on.

00:18:57.650 --> 00:19:02.490
Kings aren't supposed to be so friendly with each other.

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:03.530
Why not?

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:04.530
Huh?

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:07.200
Well... There's no real reason...

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:10.040
It's just the way it was...

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:12.580
It's better to get along!

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:14.540
Neko is right.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:19.720
Now, now... No fighting and eat this.

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:22.930
Yay! Snack time!

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:25.140
Kusanagi-san! I want some too!

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:25.970
Me too!

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:28.230
Go get it yourselves...

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:29.980
Yeah!

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:43.950
You know, Kurosuke also made
this for me the other day.

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:46.660
And he'd tell me things like,

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:51.420
"Master Ichigen used to enjoy putting
dark molasses on his pancakes."

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:55.630
Kurosuke can get pretty annoying
with his long and boring talks...

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:58.380
but I love his cooking!

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:01.010
Oh, I like your food too, guy with sunglasses.

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:02.180
Well, thank you very much.

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:06.350
Black molasses, huh? Not a bad idea.

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:08.970
So Neko-chan...

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:11.310
You like Kurosuke too, huh?

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:16.060
Shiro comes first,

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:18.480
and Kurosuke is...

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:22.820
I guess I like him after fish.

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:23.990
Neko...

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:24.990
Meow?

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:28.030
Why don't you and Kuroh come live here?

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:29.200
Meow?!

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:32.830
You can stay until Yashiro returns.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:35.830
It's safer here.

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:38.340
Don't you have your own territory?

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:39.800
I guess not,

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:43.340
since your king went missing right
after you became his clansmen.

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:46.300
Oh...

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:47.970
S-Sorry.

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:49.220
It's okay.

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:51.480
No, I'm serious!

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:55.100
Look, you can stay here like Anna said.

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:56.610
That's not what I meant!

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:57.730
Neko?

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:00.230
You see, I already have...

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:06.110
Kurosuke!

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:09.660
Where have you been?

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:13.040
I didn't want to see the boss with glasses...

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:15.210
so I was hiding out at Anna's place.

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:16.500
Are you serious?

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:19.040
What is it?

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:25.430
See this marble? It won't always show us Shiro...

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:28.390
But Anna's sure it's connected to him!

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:32.390
She said Shiro might just be watching us too!

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:34.270
That so?

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:35.770
Everything's gonna be okay!

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:37.690
So let's go home.

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:42.530
<i>I offer you SCEPTER 4's protection.</i>

00:21:42.530 --> 00:21:46.660
<i>I appreciate the offer, but no thanks.</i>

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:50.870
<i>I may not have a territory...</i>

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:53.200
<i>but I have a place to go back to.</i>

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:57.790
<i>You can stay here until Yashiro returns.</i>

00:21:57.790 --> 00:21:59.170
<i>No, that's okay.</i>

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:04.550
<i>Because I have a home where I belong!</i>

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:07.340
You're right.

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:09.010
Let's go home...

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:11.720
To where we belong!

00:22:14.060 --> 00:22:16.100
Hey, pass it!

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:19.900
You're too kind.

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:20.770
Know your place!

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:22.360
You're unjust!

00:23:59.080 --> 00:24:00.910
The place where Kuroh and Neko belong...

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:02.870
The home they've sworn to protect...

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:07.170
But the Green's vines begin to invade
even this most precious place...

00:24:08.090 --> 00:24:12.970
And the blade of his former
senior pupil comes after Kuroh's life.

00:24:13.840 --> 00:24:18.850
Will Neko's desperate cry for help
reach her king, who is far and away?

00:24:19.600 --> 00:24:22.980
Next time on <i>K: Return of Kings</i>,

00:24:22.980 --> 00:24:25.310
#3 "Kismet".

00:24:25.980 --> 00:24:27.360
Welcome back...
